# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every OS: the CI builds on Linux, where bash fails on CRLF
# (set -o pipefail\r), and Git Bash, Python, Godot are fine with LF on Windows too.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.glb  binary
*.GM1  binary
*.mp4  binary
